<title>USA: Caribou Coffee hires Boston Chicken officer.</title>
<headline>Caribou Coffee hires Boston Chicken officer.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caribou Coffee, which operates 80 stores in the Midwest and Southeast, said Friday it hired Jay Willoughby, current chief operating officer of Boston Market, as president and partner effective May 12, 1997.</p>
<p>Boston Market, a subsidiary of Boston Chicken Inc, operates 1,200 restaurants throughout the United States.</p>
<p>Caribou Coffee said that John and Kim Puckett, the company's founders, will remain actively involved in the strategic direction of the company.</p>
<p>		  ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
